"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000270","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m080-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:p081","text":"平公八年，越滅吳。二十五年卒，子宣公積立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m081-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000435","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m081-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"宣公積","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001205","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-032-qi","book_id":"b-shiji-032","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-032-qi"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p131","text":"三十一年，齊田常弒其君簡公，而立簡公弟驁爲平公。三十三年，孔子卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"齊田常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000270","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"驁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000435","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000435","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m131-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000056","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_